Test fixtures
===============================================================================

tests/fixtures/vulnerable-app and tests/fixtures/secure-app are original works
written for this project. The vulnerable fixture contains deliberately insecure
code and randomly generated strings shaped like credentials. Those strings were
never issued by any service and authenticate to nothing.
